{"speciesId":337,"names":{"fr":"Séléroc","es":"Lunatone","en":"Lunatone","ja":"ルナトーン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"LUNATONE was discovered at a location where a meteorite fell. As a result, some people theorize that this POKéMON came from space. However, no one has been able to prove this theory so far."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"LUNATONE becomes active around the time of the full moon. Instead of walking, it moves by floating in midair. The POKéMON’s intimidating red eyes cause all those who see it to become transfixed with fear."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It becomes very active on the night of a full moon. This POKéMON was first discovered 40 years ago at the site of a meteor strike."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its health ebbs and flows with the lunar cycle. It brims with power when exposed to the light of the full moon."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its health ebbs and flows with the lunar cycle. It brims with power when exposed to the light of the full moon."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It was discovered at the site of a meteor strike 40 years ago. Its stare can lull its foes to sleep."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It was discovered at the site of a meteor strike 40 years ago. Its stare can lull its foes to sleep."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On suppose qu’il est lié au cycle lunaire, car il ne sort que les soirs de pleine lune."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On suppose qu’il est lié au cycle lunaire, car il ne sort que les soirs de pleine lune."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The phase of the moon apparently has some effect on its power. It’s active on the night of a full moon."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The phase of the moon apparently has some effect on its power. It’s active on the night of a full moon."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"On suppose qu’il est lié au cycle lunaire, car il ne sort que les soirs de pleine lune."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se piensa que está muy influido por las fases lunares, ya que solo actúa en noches de luna llena."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"満月の 夜になると 活発に 活動するため 月の 満ち欠けと 関係していると 言われている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il a été découvert dans le cratère d’une météorite il y a 40 ans. Son simple regard endort ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Descubierto hace 40 años junto a un meteorito. Duerme a sus enemigos con solo mirarlos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It was discovered at the site of a meteor strike 40 years ago. Its stare can lull its foes to sleep."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"４０年前に 隕石の 落ちた 場所で 初めて 見つかった。 にらむ だけで 敵を 眠らせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Séléroc fut découvert à côté d’un cratère de météorite. Du coup, certaines personnes pensent que ce Pokémon vient de l’espace. Cependant, rien ne peut prouver cette théorie pour le moment."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lunatone fue descubierto en el lugar de impacto de un meteorito. Por eso, hay quien especula con la idea de que procede del espacio. Con todo, hasta el día de hoy nadie ha podido probar esta teoría."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lunatone was discovered at a location where a meteoroid fell. As a result, some people theorize that this Pokémon came from space. However, no one has been able to prove this theory so far."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"隕石の 落ちた 場所から 見つかったため 宇宙から やってきた ポケモンという 説も あるが まだ 証明されていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Séléroc ne s’active que pendant la période de pleine lune. Il ne marche pas, mais se déplace en lévitant. Les yeux rouges et intimidants de ce Pokémon pétrifient ses ennemis de terreur."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lunatone entra en actividad en épocas de luna llena más o menos. No camina, se desplaza flotando por el aire. Tiene unos ojos rojos sobrecogedores que cortan la respiración a todo aquel que los ve."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lunatone becomes active around the time of the full moon. Instead of walking, it moves by floating in midair. The Pokémon’s intimidating red eyes cause all those who see it to become transfixed with fear."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"満月の 時期 活発になる 習性。 空中に 浮いて 移動し 赤い 瞳は 見たものの 体を すくませる 迫力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Sa force est liée au cycle lunaire. Il est surtout actif les soirs de pleine lune."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se piensa que las fases lunares tienen relación con la fluctuación de su poder. Se vuelve activo las noches de luna llena."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The phase of the moon apparently has some effect on its power. It’s active on the night of a full moon."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"月の 満ち欠けと パワーの 増減が 関係 しているらしく 満月の 夜 活発になる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il a été découvert dans le cratère d’une météorite il y a 40 ans. Un simple regard de sa part endort ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Fue descubierto hace 40 años en el lugar donde había caído un meteorito. Le basta fulminar a sus enemigos con la mirada para dormirlos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It was discovered at the site of a meteor strike 40 years ago. Its stare can lull its foes to sleep."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"４０年前に 隕石の 落ちた 場所で 初めて 見つかった。 にらむ だけで 敵を 眠らせる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":337,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-throw","learns":[[5,"level-up",13],[6,"level-up",13],[7,"level-up",13],[8,"level-up",9],[9,"level-up",9],[10,"level-up",9],[11,"level-up",9],[12,"leve